From 713f32440b0750a54bf1df499df4ad7db6052e42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c4pp4
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:57:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Draw a rounded shadow around menus

A menu is never the active window, so Unity gives it the shadow of
inactive windows, which Yaru makes transparent. And Unity draws the
shadow of a rectangle, so with a visible inactive shadow, the rounded
corners of a menu showed the background between the menu and the
square shadow.

Give menus that publish the radius of their corners in
_UNITY_GTK_BORDER_RADIUS the shadow of the active window, in the shape
of the menu with these corners, and paint it also under the transparent
corners of the menu.

Signed-off-by: c4pp4
---
